  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Di Moody - Nakuruto WASH Project - Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Title:&#xa0;Di Moody&#xa0;Nakuruto&#xa0;WASH project, Kenya&#xa0;&#xa0;



Start and end dates:&#xa0;01/01/2020 &#x2013; 31/12/2020 (12 months)&#xa0;&#xa0;


Summary:&#xa0;The project is expected to increase access to clean and safe water and improved hygiene and sanitation among 11,000 women, men, girls and boys in&#xa0;Nakuruto, through;&#xa0;




Provision of water infrastructure; rehabilitation of&#xa0;Nakuruto&#xa0;borehole and pipeline extension to 20 villages&#xa0;&#xa0;






Hygiene and sanitation promotion activities&#xa0;at community level &amp; in schools&#xa0;&#xa0;








Strengthened governance and management of water facilities&#xa0;




Location:&#xa0;Taita&#xa0;Taveta County, Kenya&#xa0;&#xa0;


Beneficiaries:&#xa0;11,000&#xa0;


Donor:&#xa0;Di Moody Foundation&#xa0;&amp; PPL&#xa0;(RF)&#xa0;


PNSs/Partners:&#xa0;KRCS&#xa0;&#xa0;



Budget:&#xa0;&#xa3;362,250</narrative>
  </description>
